Subject: [PATCH] Gamescope 3.16.28 SteamOS Anland integration

Shared backend lives in ../anland_backend; no public implementation is copied here.
Includes Steam ARM64 focus/night-mode/white-point/P3 fixes (virtudude, JPyke3),
realtime queue/gamepad cursor adaptation, bounded local IME and system script path.

